into the shoes, so...

00:05:55.934 --> 00:05:59.734
-Yeah. No one has the same pair
of these --

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:02.133
Well, unless they're these.
-Exactly.

00:06:02.133 --> 00:06:04.434
-Yeah. It's a lot.
It's very deep.

00:06:04.434 --> 00:06:05.567
Alright. So you --

00:06:05.567 --> 00:06:07.901
