a real-life convention.

00:06:22.467 --> 00:06:25.267
So every year I host
a Sneaker of the Year panel.

00:06:25.267 --> 00:06:27.834
It's a very heated debate.

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:32.067
DJ Clark Kent is one
of the panelists who --

00:06:32.067 --> 00:06:33.901
Quest, again.
Quest, you know DJ Clark Kent.

00:06:33.901 --> 00:06:35.868
One of the biggest
sneaker collectors.

00:06:35.868 --> 00:06:39.067
