-Are you ready for the Internet
to come after you over --

00:09:44.467 --> 00:09:46.334
-Yeah. Bring it. Bring it.
I don't care. Yeah, please.

00:09:46.334 --> 00:09:48.634
Are you kidding me?
Yeah, please.

00:09:48.634 --> 00:09:51.501
Do you think I care?
I got my own sneaker, buddy.

00:09:51.501 --> 00:09:53.901
I don't care. I'm gonna say --
Get rid of these guys.

00:09:53.901 --> 00:09:55.367
I do love Drake.

00:09:55.367 --> 00:09:58.000
Tiffany. I think they'll do fine
without winning this.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.934
-Right, right, right.
-They're doing okay.

00:09:59.934 --> 00:10:01.467
It's one of --

00:10:01.467 --> 00:10:02.801
-Wow. Okay.
-It's down to these two.

00:10:02.801 --> 00:10:04.667
And I think the winner is...

00:10:04.667 --> 00:10:06.367
[ Drum roll ]

00:10:06.367 --> 00:10:07.701
This one.

00:10:07.701 --> 00:10:08.901
-Okay.
-That's the winner right there.

00:10:08.901 --> 00:10:11.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.868
-Listen. Listen.

00:10:13.868 --> 00:10:17.167
-I said it! I said it!
I said what I had to say!

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:19.133
-That's the front-runner.
That's the front-runner.

00:10:19.133 --> 00:10:21.234
-Oh, it is the front-runner.
-Yeah. So you're right on trend.

00:10:21.234 --> 00:10:24.067
-Oh, wait. But it already
is the front-runner?

00:10:24.067 --> 00:10:25.367
-That's what people --
We'll see.

00:10:25.367 --> 00:10:27.033
We'll see in November.

00:10:27.033 --> 00:10:28.634
-I'm gonna go back to this one.
-No, no, no. You're good.

00:10:28.634 --> 00:10:32.167
Stick with your gut. But people
love -- love this shoe.

00:10:32.167 --> 00:10:35.734
The marrying of Nike SB
and Jordan on a Jordan 4.

00:10:35.734 --> 00:10:38.167
And you can skate in it.
I saw your promo with MSCHF.

00:10:38.167 --> 00:10:39.934
You were skateboarding
a little bit.

00:10:39.934 --> 00:10:42.167
-Of course. I skateboard
all the time at work.

00:10:42.167 --> 00:10:45.434
Are you kidding me?
I'm Mr. Skateboard.

00:10:45.434 --> 00:10:47.934
"Jimmy, where's your board?"
-I saw that.

00:10:47.934 --> 00:10:50.868
-Joe La Puma. Thank you so much
for coming to the show.

00:10:50.868 --> 00:10:52.667
We know we love you
and come back, okay?

00:10:52.667 --> 00:10:54.801
-Before we go. Before we go.

00:10:54.801 --> 00:10:57.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:57.467 --> 00:11:01.167
Before we go, when
I interviewed you on my show,

00:11:01.167 --> 00:11:03.067
we talked about the Air Max 95.

00:11:03.067 --> 00:11:06.567
I think you wore it to, like,
the Kids' Choice Awards in 2004.

00:11:06.567 --> 00:11:09.234
And, you know, you're back
to work, back to school.

00:11:09.234 --> 00:11:11.934
A new Air Max 95 for you.
-Yo! Come on, bud!

00:11:11.934 --> 00:11:14.901
That's what I'm talking about!
That's my size!

00:11:14.901 --> 00:11:17.601
12.5.
That's my jam right there.

00:11:17.601 --> 00:11:21.200
Come on! That's my dude!
You don't have to do that.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.868
-Come on.
-I got you. You're good.

00:11:22.868 --> 00:11:25.033
-Joe La Puma.
Check out new episodes

00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:28.133
of "Sneaker Shopping"
Mondays on YouTube.

